## Runner limits

CI runs on the shared, non-privileged runner: internet egress only, no
LAN/tailnet, no SSH, no Docker-in-Docker, every job as a non-root UID. Lint,
kubeconform, secret scanning and registry push all work; anything needing
privilege or LAN access does not.
{%- endif %}
